{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13204120","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13204120","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1320412001:0":{"text":"Hugin! We got everything!","source_cn":"呼金！你需要的材料我们都找到了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C3B20A20A4C1168","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320412002:0":{"text":"I knew I could count on you! Even on this icy mountain, you're quicker than a snow hare!","source_cn":"嚯，真不愧是你们！到了这冰天雪地的地方，手脚还是一样麻利！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x185DAA3B68AFACE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320412003:0":{"text":"Alright, leave the rest to me!","source_cn":"行了，接下来就看我的吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB8EC8228A68CF8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:6:1320412004:0":{"text":"With a confident grin, Hugin grabs his tools, and after a symphony of clanking and hammering, the temperature detector is complete.","source_cn":"呼金拿起工具敲敲打打，好一阵之后，才终于做好了温差探测器","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBD3BDF5E4D9F373","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320412005:1":{"text":"Wow! Is this the final version of the detector?","source_cn":"哇！这就是探测器的最终成品了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB460E3AF0A8098D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:7::3":{"text":"Boil-O-Scope","source_cn":"温差探测器","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78742052C485E5A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320412006:0":{"text":"Yup! You can call it the \"Boil-O-Scope\"! It detects areas with big temperature differences within a certain range, and it's unaffected by the terrain.","source_cn":"没错！你们可以叫他“热灯”。他能在一定范围内发现温差较...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37E2280AD6329C2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320412007:0":{"text":"Um... So how do I use device?","source_cn":"……呃，那我要怎么使用热灯？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F0F8E1AA85BE0FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320412008:0":{"text":"Simple, just keep it with you! When it senses a temperature difference, it'll make a sound and point to the exact location.","source_cn":"很简单，带着他四处走走就行。只要识别到温差，他就会发出...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B6D3212066581E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320412009:0":{"text":"But be careful! I had to use rare materials from my homeland to get it this precise. If it breaks, I can't fix it.","source_cn":"你们使用的时候千万得小心！为了提高热灯的精准度，我用了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD021E3F8F1A954EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320412010:0":{"text":"Understood, I'll be careful. Thanks a lot!","source_cn":"嗯，我会小心的，多谢啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40784A8279A2A85C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1320412011:0":{"text":"Madam Gerda, where should we start looking?","source_cn":"格尔达女士，接下来我们去哪里探测温差呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31AE7BB88662C485","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1320412012:0":{"text":"The river near the inn and the hills behind it. There might be wild hot springs around those spots.","source_cn":"<style=highlight>靠近旅店的河边</s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFCB2A07115016D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1320412013:0":{"text":"Let's head to the river first. It's on the way back to the inn anyway.","source_cn":"先去河边看看吧！正好返回旅店的路上要经过那里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x443202928A69A521","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female